OL,3,AFamily pays tribute to 'warm and
OL,4,Aengaging' man killed in tiger attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis family added: "It will be for the
OL,7,Fcoroner to decide what part this played
OL,8,Fin his death. We would ask everybody to
OL,9,Frespect that process."
